# Codex Project Rules - [[ project_name ]]

## Project Overview
This repository is [[ project_name ]], a multi-tenant boilerplate for authenticated
B2B products: FastAPI backend, Next.js frontend, and a React Router 7 +
Fumadocs docs site.

`AGENTS.md` at the repo root is the single detailed instruction source. Read it
before making changes; these rules only summarize it.

## Rules
- Backend (`backend/src`) follows Clean Architecture with DDD:
  `domain -> application -> infrastructure -> presentation`.
- Frontend follows the feature-first flow:
  `app -> features -> entities -> shared`
  (see `docs/internal/architecture/frontend-architecture.md`).
- Browser code must call the backend only through same-origin Next.js BFF
  routes under `/api/...`.
- Use the existing `just` commands for local development:
  `just backend`, `just frontend`, and `just docs`.
- Keep docs, tests, fixtures, and examples focused on [[ project_name ]] and its
  current core modules.
